+      <section anchor="other-options-and-telnet-control-sequences" numbered="false" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-unnumbered-1.3">
+        <name slugifiedName="name-c-other-options-and-telnet-control-sequences">C. Other Options and TELNET Control Sequences</name>
+        <t indent="0" pn="section-unnumbered-1.3-1">Our server will refuse all other options by sending the appropriate
